### Payments (sandboxed UPI simulation) — example requests
### No external gateway, no API keys needed.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@accessToken = $2b$10$GN9hi0LdALtVdW/vo.SjS.y0KAPZQb8n6FNaZeuxKqwc7I22l7BHm
@cardId = PASTE_A_REAL_CARD_ID_WITH_UPIID_SET

### 1. Initiate a payment (creates a PENDING transaction)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/upi/initiate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardId": "{{cardId}}",
  "amount": 150,
  "category": "Dining",
  "payeeUpiId": "merchant@sandbox"
}

### 2. Confirm the payment (simulates the PSP callback)
### Copy txnId from step 1's response.
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/upi/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "txnId": "PASTE_TXN_ID_HERE",
  "outcome": "SUCCESS"
}

### 3. Try confirming a failure instead, for the failure-handling case
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/upi/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "txnId": "PASTE_ANOTHER_TXN_ID_HERE",
  "outcome": "FAILED"
}
